  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Fiscal and Social Management Improvement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Mejora Fiscal y Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la gestin fiscal y social, a travs de un aumento en la eficiencia y transparencia, tanto de la recaudacin como del gasto, a fin de contribuir al crecimiento econmico sostenido y a la reduccin de la pobreza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the fiscal and social administration, through the increase of efficiency and transparency in the tax collection as well as in public expenditure. This way it will contribute to a sustainable economicd growth and to the reduction of poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
